    "name": "RCI-M MetaboLights QSRR Modeling",
    "readme": "A generalized linear regression model is trained using scikit-learn to predict retention times based on physico-chemical property descriptors calculated using RDKit. The dataset is split into training and test set and model performance is evaluated on the held-out test set.\n\nThe work was supported by the ESFRI Research Infrastructure ELIXIR programme 2024\u20132028, Commissioned Service Project Plan (COS) and its WP5 (Next level of reproducible, comparable and integrable Metabolomics) \u2013 funded by the European Union\u2019s Horizon Europe Programme under grant agreement number 101131096.",
    "report": {
